+      // this family cure six reds by ASSIGNING a house curve at sites HEAD left bare — an axis
+      // the spec put out of scope, moved unmeasured (pass-3 critique §2.5). The assignments are
+      // reverted; the count is what it is, and `none` is in it.
+      if ((q.curve !== "bare" && q.curve !== "none") || seen.has(q.clause)) continue;
