+/**
+ * B10 — THE PINNED CITE. Three sites carry a length that is itself a RULING, and a retune
+ * there has to re-audition the ruling by name. The check asserts three things per site, on
+ * CONTENT and never on a line: the cite string is present at the site; the value IS the rung
+ * (never a literal); and the rung's own docstring names the same ruling.
