+    // name AND type-checks it against the verb's own fence, which is strictly more than
+    // `MOTION.rungs.<rung>` ever did — the reading is the same reading, taken through the door.
+    // The law is unchanged: a pinned value is the rung, never a literal beside it.
+    if (
+      !new RegExp(
